; German texts of NOTEPAD.EXE (SuperPad of Visual C++ 1.52 as Notepad, from
; the English Windows 3.1x Update Script): English<TAB>German, \n, \t and \b as
; in the resources.  The words follow the German Notepad of Windows 3.11
; (menus) and the German WordPad of Windows 95 (the MFC texts).
